1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,760
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,472
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,168
♪You really love me♪

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,008
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:07,024 --> 00:00:08,730
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,192
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,696
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,712 --> 00:00:15,260
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,100
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,656
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,688 --> 00:00:20,540
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,192
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:23,776
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,280
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,660
=The One=

16
00:00:29,712 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 10=

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:51,840
Feel better now?

18
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,680
Why do you like ice cream so much?

19
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:15,040
When I was little,

20
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,200
my mom always bought it for me.

21
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:18,879
She said

22
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,480
whenever I felt sick

23
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,319
or upset,

24
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,239
eating something sweet

25
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:25,959
would make me feel better.

26
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:29,840
Su Yan.

27
00:01:30,879 --> 00:01:31,840
If you can't forget

28
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,120
what happened,

29
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:35,439
then don't.

30
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,719
Revenge is a dish

31
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:48,159
best served cold.

32
00:01:56,512 --> 00:01:59,024
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

33
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:02,768
♪I hum this song alone♪

34
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:06,490
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

35
00:02:06,540 --> 00:02:10,256
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

36
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:13,720
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

37
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:17,240
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

38
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:20,760
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

39
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:24,520
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

40
00:02:32,224 --> 00:02:34,010
(Cheng Shuping, Cheng Lin's mother)

41
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:36,080
Hi. Feel free to look around.

42
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:37,960
Hi.

43
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,400
I'm here to see him.

44
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,176
(Cheng Family Market)

45
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,719
So this is where you live.

46
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,840
Your family runs this little store?

47
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:52,039
What's your relationship with Su Yan?

48
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:53,120
None of your business.

49
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,800
She seduced my dad.

50
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,120
He was her professor.

51
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,560
She's got a fiancé on her level.

52
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:01,199
She only dates men she can use.

53
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:02,680
Be with me instead.

54
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,199
If you say yes,

55
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:05,680
this car is yours.

56
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,439
Is everyone in your family

57
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:10,599
this disgusting?

58
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:13,960
With a family like yours,

59
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:15,360
why act so high and mighty?

60
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:17,120
How much is Su Yan paying to keep you?

61
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:19,039
Don't worry.

62
00:03:19,039 --> 00:03:20,400
I'll pay you more than she does.

63
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,360
- Get lost.
- What are you doing?

64
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,280
Cheng Lin!

65
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,120
Mom.

66
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,759
Ma'am, do I need to spell it out?

67
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,120
The landlord

68
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,280
already sold me this place.

69
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:31,960
(Store Transfer Agreement)
Here's the contract.

70
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,280
Renovations start tomorrow morning.

71
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,680
Be out by tonight.

72
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:36,879
Cheng Lin.

73
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:42,992
(Zhang Jianyu)

74
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,439
Just say yes,

75
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:49,080
and I'll give you this place.

76
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,360
Su Yan's... sister?

77
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,240
Yeah.

78
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,479
Does she know you're this stupid?

79
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,240
Tearing it up won't help.

80
00:04:05,439 --> 00:04:07,000
There's already a copy on file.

81
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,520
Did you even look into me

82
00:04:10,919 --> 00:04:11,879
before you came after me?

83
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:14,080
The signature on that contract

84
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,280
is my stepfather's.

85
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,639
Five years ago,

86
00:04:17,639 --> 00:04:19,000
I almost killed him.

87
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,240
When my mom divorced him five years ago,

88
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,399
this place

89
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:25,360
was awarded to her.

90
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,480
Take this to court,

91
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,160
and you'll lose.

92
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:30,319
You'll just waste your parents' money.

93
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:31,399
I don't care about money.

94
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:32,399
Smash it up.

95
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,079
There's a bonus.

96
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,759
No! You can't! Stop!

97
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:36,560
Yao!

98
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,680
Don't think I won't hit a woman.

99
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:40,519
If you lay a finger on me,

100
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,800
my dad will have you thrown in jail.

101
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:43,920
Your dad?

102
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,160
I don't mind going down with him.

103
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,319
Cheng Lin, don't do anything stupid.

104
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,759
Let's get a lawyer for this.

105
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:52,000
Let go! Come on, let go!

106
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,560
Cheng Lin.

107
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:55,639
Let go.

108
00:05:04,279 --> 00:05:06,439
Su Yan, who are you to boss me around?

109
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,759
Because he's mine.

110
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,760
(Su Yan.)

111
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,960
(Tell me.)

112
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,560
(What would make you feel better?)

113
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:32,960
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

114
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:36,480
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

115
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:40,000
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

116
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:43,760
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

117
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:02,240
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

118
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:05,880
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

119
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:09,080
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

120
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:12,760
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

121
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:16,160
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

122
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:19,840
♪I hum this song alone♪

123
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:23,680
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

124
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:27,760
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

125
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:31,040
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

126
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:34,640
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

127
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:38,120
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

128
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:43,000
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
